te1, Number date2, String type\\)":[116,209],"#PASnapshot- Scoped#PASnapshot - getCompareQuery\\(String sys\\_id, Number date1, Number date2, String type\\)#{1}":[118,179],"#PASnapshot- Scoped#PASnapshot - getCompareQuery\\(String sys\\_id, Number date1, Number date2, String type\\)#{2}":[180,180],"#PASnapshot- Scoped#PASnapshot - getCompareQuery\\(String sys\\_id, Number date1, Number date2, String type\\)#{3}":[181,181],"#PASnapshot- Scoped#PASnapshot - getCompareQuery\\(String sys\\_id, Number date1, Number date2, String type\\)#{4}":[182,182],"#PASnapshot- Scoped#PASnapshot - getCompareQuery\\(String sys\\_id, Number date1, Number date2, String type\\)#{5}":[183,183],"#PASnapshot- Scoped#PASnapshot - getCompareQuery\\(String sys\\_id, Number date1, Number date2, String type\\)#{6}":[184,185],"#PASnapshot- Scoped#PASnapshot - getCompareQuery\\(String sys\\_id, Number date1, Number date2, String type\\)#{7}":[186,209],"#PASnapshot- Scoped#PASnapshot - getIDs\\(String sys\\_id, Number date\\)":[210,265],"#PASnapshot- Scoped#PASnapshot - getIDs\\(String sys\\_id, Number date\\)#{1}":[212,265],"#PASnapshot- Scoped#PASnapshot - getQuery\\(String sys\\_id, Number date\\)":[266,327],"#PASnapshot- Scoped#PASnapshot - getQuery\\(String sys\\_id, Number date\\)#{1}":[268,327]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Server API reference","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/api-server.md","line":28}],"metadata":{"title":"PASnapshot - Scoped","description":"The PASnapshot API enables you to query information about Performance Analytics snapshots. Snapshots are the lists of records \\(sys\\_ids\\) that are collected at the time that the scores for those records are collected. A snapshot is made only for automated indicators with Collect records selected.Compares records in snapshots for a specified indicator at multiple dates, such as to identify records included in one snapshot but not the other.Returns the query used to compare records in snapshots for a specified indicator at multiple dates.Returns the sys\\_id values for all records contained in the snapshot for a specified indicator at the specified date.Returns the query used to generate the snapshot for a specified indicator at the specified date.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/PASnapshot.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":2,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[105,108],[112,114],[191,195],[199,208],[255,258],[262,264],[311,314],[318,325]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/server-api-reference/PASnapshot.md"},
